@startuml proposed-v2-overview
title GateGoldJira - A simple view of the proposed database
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 45

rectangle "<b>Projects and people</b>\nProjects, accounts and membership\nProject admin / member / viewer" as access #DBEAFE
rectangle "<b>Workflows</b>\nStages, allowed moves and approvals\nTypes choose defaults; issues keep their flow" as workflow #EDE9FE
rectangle "<b>Issues</b>\nTitle, type, priority, assignee and dates\nSubtasks, blockers and typed custom fields" as work #DBEAFE
rectangle "<b>Boards</b>\nFiltered views of the same issues\nIndependent columns, order and WIP limits" as boards #DCFCE7
rectangle "<b>Discussion and files</b>\nComments and retained edit history\nOne attachment model for every file" as discussion #FEF3C7
rectangle "<b>Planning</b>\nEpics and releases\nIssue assignments to each" as planning #FCE7F3
rectangle "<b>Reliable operations</b>\nNotifications, audit and safe retries\nUpload sessions and cleanup" as operations #F1F5F9

access -down-> work : owns
workflow -right-> work
work -right-> boards
work -down-> discussion : has
work -down-> planning : belongs to
discussion -down-> operations
planning -down-> operations

legend bottom
  DESIGN V2 - not applied to the app or database.
  Boxes are logical groups, not individual tables or services.
  One PostgreSQL database; file bytes remain in private Cloud Storage.
  Full table inventory and rules: proposed-v2-design.txt.
endlegend
@enduml
